surface-pro-9-linux
https://github.com/joonhoekim/surface-pro-9-linux

Linux support for the Microsoft Surface Pro 9 with an Intel CPU
(SKU Surface_Pro_9_2038).

This is an independent project. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by or
endorsed by Microsoft, Intel, Realtek or the linux-surface project.

Built on linux-surface
----------------------

The kernel this repository builds is Linux v7.3.4 with the linux-surface patch
series for 7.3 and this repository's patches on top:

  https://github.com/linux-surface/linux-surface
  commit ea852b4eff5ed641571e13766bda5bd9cf121983 (the pin in flake.nix)

linux-surface is not copied into this repository; it is fetched at that commit
when the kernel is built and stays under its own licences.

Patches from other authors
--------------------------

kernel/patches/0001 to 0010 were not written for this repository. They come
from upstream Linux and from pull requests to the linux-surface kernel tree,
as kernel/PROVENANCE.md records patch by patch. They keep their authors and
sign-offs unchanged:

  0001        Sakari Ailus
  0002-0006   Fernando Rimoli (0006 also signed off by Arsalan Naeem)
  0007-0010   Jairo Valdivia

All kernel patches are licensed GPL-2.0-only, as the Linux kernel is.

